{"4736370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UnderWorldMMORPG", "steam_appid": 4736370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNDERWORLD MMORPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey in a living world, full of adventures, challenges, and rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNDERWORLD MMORPG is an online game where you explore a vast universe, face powerful enemies, evolve your character, and discover a story rich in mysteries, all at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A World to Explore Travel through different regions, each with its own dangers, creatures, and secrets. From dark lands to unknown dimensions, there's always something new waiting for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The World of Dragons takes you to a dimension dominated by ancient creatures, where epic challenges and rare rewards await. Dungeons offer intense experiences, with dangerous enemies, traps, and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/extras/3bc21a15f0966568032a2981c4bb0840.avif?t=1787277165\" width=1332 height=750 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Evolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat takes place in real time, combining skill, magic, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The progression system is free, allowing you to develop your character in any way you prefer, without rigid limitations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system includes dodging with cooldowns and timing-based blocking mechanics. By executing the block at the right moment, it's possible to completely negate incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/extras/9b2d438ff7ed413e7eb6e4836a175efc.avif?t=1787277165\" width=1360 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction and Immersion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with dialogue bring the world to life, offering stories, quests, and decisions that enrich your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can speak directly to NPCs using the microphone, making the interaction more natural and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests offer varied challenges, from hunts to confrontations with powerful enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/extras/631df21e677e1224939f2edd4f071693.avif?t=1787277165\" width=1360 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Professions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forging system with mini-game allows you to create and improve equipment interactively, rewarding precision and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon reaching over 80% quality in forging, your name is permanently engraved on the item, which receives random attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your reputation and become a world-renowned blacksmith, creating unique equipment that can be used by other players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/extras/2376c78d32fc52cc7ca54ba1a2935ff8.avif?t=1787277165\" width=1360 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game in Evolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with technology based on a visual editor, UNDERWORLD MMORPG is constantly evolving, with frequent updates and new content being added regularly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Journey Begins Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, evolve, and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of UNDERWORLD MMORPG and play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNDERWORLD MMORPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey in a living world, full of adventures, challenges, and rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNDERWORLD MMORPG is an online game where you explore a vast universe, face powerful enemies, evolve your character, and discover a story rich in mysteries, all at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A World to Explore Travel through different regions, each with its own dangers, creatures, and secrets. From dark lands to unknown dimensions, there's always something new waiting for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The World of Dragons takes you to a dimension dominated by ancient creatures, where epic challenges and rare rewards await. Dungeons offer intense experiences, with dangerous enemies, traps, and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/extras/3bc21a15f0966568032a2981c4bb0840.avif?t=1787277165\" width=1332 height=750 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Evolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat takes place in real time, combining skill, magic, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The progression system is free, allowing you to develop your character in any way you prefer, without rigid limitations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system includes dodging with cooldowns and timing-based blocking mechanics. By executing the block at the right moment, it's possible to completely negate incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/extras/9b2d438ff7ed413e7eb6e4836a175efc.avif?t=1787277165\" width=1360 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction and Immersion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with dialogue bring the world to life, offering stories, quests, and decisions that enrich your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can speak directly to NPCs using the microphone, making the interaction more natural and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests offer varied challenges, from hunts to confrontations with powerful enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/extras/631df21e677e1224939f2edd4f071693.avif?t=1787277165\" width=1360 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Professions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forging system with mini-game allows you to create and improve equipment interactively, rewarding precision and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon reaching over 80% quality in forging, your name is permanently engraved on the item, which receives random attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your reputation and become a world-renowned blacksmith, creating unique equipment that can be used by other players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/extras/2376c78d32fc52cc7ca54ba1a2935ff8.avif?t=1787277165\" width=1360 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game in Evolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with technology based on a visual editor, UNDERWORLD MMORPG is constantly evolving, with frequent updates and new content being added regularly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Journey Begins Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, evolve, and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of UNDERWORLD MMORPG and play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "UNDERWORLD MMORPG is an open-world MMORPG focused on immersion and freedom. Talk to NPCs via microphone, become a dragon in the Dragon World, and level up professions in mini-games. Craft items in an evolving forge where skill defines quality. A living world where your choices shape your journey.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/8a781a8432b901e354b6847cd17b9bb6b96d2e03/header.jpg?t=1787277165", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/098dab89d76978392e50c11c9fb74e048c3ac01f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787277165", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736370/098dab89d76978392e50c11c9fb74e048c3ac01f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787277165", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8500 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Compatible with DirectX<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A stable internet connection is required for online resources and interaction with servers.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li